SUMMARY:Written in Brooklyn Storytelling Series presents Goodbyes & Hellos
DESCRIPTION:From breaking ties to new adventures. Grab a drink and enjoy true stories about moving on and starting over. \n\n\n\n\nWelcom to the Written in Brooklyn Storytelling Series! A night of true stories that will make you feel so much better about your own life. \nThis month’s theme is Goodbyes & Hellos. Throw on something cute\, grab a cocktail\, and settle in for a night of wild tales about leaving the old\, welcoming the new\, and the humor that comes with the hardship. We’ve got it all at the Written in Brooklyn Storytelling Series. \nDecember 2nd at Farm.One. \nDoors 7. Show 8pm. \nWe’ll have very good pizza by Pizza Party so come early\, grab a good seat and a slice! \nWe love your pet\, but please no dogs. Service animals welcome! \nSee you there!
URL:https://farm.one/event/written-in-brooklyn-storytelling-series-presents-goodbyes-hellos/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://farm.one/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/wib-poster-dec-2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
