SUMMARY:Burlesque at Farm.One
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Tassels to Table. \nFarm.One’s back lounge is going full cabaret on December 11th at 8pm for an intimate burlesque experience you won’t find anywhere else in Brooklyn. Hosted by the fabulous Maine Attraction\, this evening features four stunning performers — KingQueen\, Logan L’Enfer\, Nirah\, and Pete ZaParty — plus a special menu from Pizza Party. Wash it all down with any of the delicious Farm.One house made beers or specialty cocktails. \nThis is a seated\, curated night for a small crowd. Tickets go fast and the room is small on purpose 👀 \nAll seated tickets include a short pour & a bite. Doors at 8pm. Back lounge only. 21+. \n📍 625 Bergen Street\, Brooklyn\, NY 11217
URL:https://farm.one/event/burlesque-at-farm-one-3/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://farm.one/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_8186.jpeg
END:VEVENT
