UID:10000194-1802977200-1802984400@farm.one
SUMMARY:Trivia Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for NYC Trivia League’s recurring weekly trivia\, hosted by Mickey Nolan.\nFirst place gets $50 off their bar tab. \nSecond place gets a round of shots. \nThird place gets a round of short pour beers. \nFourth and fifth have been known to receive a special present from our dear host… \nPlease note\, there is no cap on the number of participants per team\, but you can only win the prizes with groups of 6 or fewer. 
URL:https://farm.one/event/trivia-night/2027-02-18/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://farm.one/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/new-trivia-wide.png
